---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo">Tu<span>Pega</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#features">Funciones</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Planes</a>
      <a href="#how">Cómo funciona</a>
    </div>
    <a href="/acceso" class="btn-pill">Acceso</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <img src="/hero_bg.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="hero-img" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-badge reveal">Automatización inteligente de correos</div>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-d1">Tu próximo empleo o<br/><span class="grad">cliente, automatizado</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal reveal-d2">Plataforma diseñada para profesionales buscando trabajo y empresas prospectando. Envía correos masivos personalizados, filtra rebotes y gestiona respuestas sin esfuerzo manual.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas reveal reveal-d3">
      <a href="/acceso" class="btn-pill btn-lg">Empezar gratis</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">Ver cómo funciona</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats reveal reveal-d4">
      <div class="stat"><span>2,700+</span><p>contactos enviados</p></div>
      <div class="stat-sep"></div>
      <div class="stat"><span>98%</span><p>tasa de entrega</p></div>
      <div class="stat-sep"></div>
      <div class="stat"><span>5x</span><p>más respuestas</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="label reveal">Funcionalidades</p>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">Todo lo que necesitas para<br/><span class="grad">tu éxito profesional y comercial</span></h2>
    <div class="bento">
      <div class="bcard bcard-wide reveal reveal-d1">
        <div class="bcard-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Envío masivo personalizado</h3>
        <p>Carga tu lista de contactos y envía correos personalizados con nombre, empresa y firma profesional. Ideal para adjuntar tu CV o tu portafolio de servicios.</p>
        <span class="tag">Gmail SMTP</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard reveal reveal-d2">
        <div class="bcard-icon bcard-icon--teal">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Smart Bounce Filter</h3>
        <p>Detecta y elimina automáticamente correos inválidos. Mantén tu reputación de remitente intacta.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard reveal reveal-d3">
        <div class="bcard-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Dashboard en tiempo real</h3>
        <p>Visualiza enviados, rebotes, respuestas y pendientes en un panel limpio y sin ruido.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard bcard-accent reveal reveal-d4">
        <div class="bcard-icon bcard-icon--inv">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23-.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1 1 .03 2.798-1.338 2.798a.5.5 0 01-.37-.16l-2.893-3.15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Gestión de respuestas</h3>
        <p>Organiza tu bandeja por campaña, detecta leads calientes e identifica reclutadores interesados automáticamente.</p>
        <span class="tag tag--inv">Auto-sync</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard bcard-wide">
        <img src="/dashboard_preview.png" alt="Vista previa del dashboard de TuPega" class="bcard-preview" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="label reveal">Proceso</p>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">De cero a <span class="grad">cientos de contactos</span><br/>en un solo día</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal reveal-d1">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Sube tu archivo y lista</h3>
        <p>Carga tu CV o presentación de servicios junto al Excel de contactos. TuPega hace el resto.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-line reveal reveal-d2"></div>
      <div class="step reveal reveal-d2">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Configura tu campaña</h3>
        <p>Define asunto, mensaje y límites de envío diario para proteger tu cuenta.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-line reveal reveal-d3"></div>
      <div class="step reveal reveal-d3">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Lanza y monitorea</h3>
        <p>TuPega envía, filtra rebotes y te notifica cuando llegan respuestas reales.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="pricing">
  <div class="container pricing-wrap">
    <p class="label reveal">Planes</p>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">Comienza <span class="grad">gratis hoy</span></h2>
    <div class="pricing reveal reveal-d2">
      <div class="pcard">
        <p class="tier">Gratis</p>
        <div class="price">$0<span>/mes</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>50 correos/día</li>
          <li>200 contactos</li>
          <li>1 campaña activa</li>
          <li>Dashboard básico</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/acceso" class="btn-ghost btn-full">Empezar gratis</a>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard pcard-featured">
        <div class="pfeatured-label">Popular</div>
        <p class="tier">Pro</p>
        <div class="price">$12<span>/mes</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>500 correos/día</li>
          <li>Contactos ilimitados</li>
          <li>Campañas ilimitadas</li>
          <li>Smart Bounce Filter</li>
          <li>Gestión de respuestas</li>
          <li>Scraper de contactos</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/acceso" class="btn-pill btn-full">Comenzar Pro</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo">Tu<span>Pega</span></a>
    <p>© 2026 TuPega. Hecho en Chile.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</Layout>

<style>
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;padding:20px 32px;backdrop-filter:blur(20px);background:rgba(8,6,20,0.7);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}
.nav-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px}
.logo{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text)}
.logo span{color:var(--color-primary)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:32px;margin-left:auto}
.nav-links a{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-2);transition:color .2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--color-text)}
.btn-pill{background:var(--color-primary);color:#fff;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s}
.btn-pill:hover{opacity:.85;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-pill.btn-lg{padding:14px 32px;font-size:1rem}
.btn-pill.btn-full{display:block;text-align:center;padding:12px;border-radius:999px}
.btn-ghost{color:var(--color-text-2);border:1px solid var(--color-border-2);padding:10px 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:500;font-size:.9rem;transition:all .2s}
.btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--color-text);border-color:var(--color-border-3)}
.btn-ghost.btn-full{display:block;text-align:center;padding:12px;margin-top:auto}

.hero{position:relative;padding:160px 32px 100px;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0}
.hero-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.35}
.hero-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(8,6,20,.4) 0%,rgba(8,6,20,.95) 85%)}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;position:relative}
.hero-badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--color-surface-2);border:1px solid var(--color-border-2);color:var(--color-primary-2);padding:6px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:24px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.5rem);font-weight:700;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 24px}
.grad{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-primary-2),var(--color-secondary));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.hero-sub{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--color-text-2);max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 40px;line-height:1.7}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:64px}
.hero-stats{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:48px}
.stat span{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;display:block;color:var(--color-text)}
.stat p{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--color-text-3);margin-top:2px}
.stat-sep{width:1px;height:40px;background:var(--color-border-2)}

.section{padding:96px 32px}
.label{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--color-primary-2);display:block;margin-bottom:16px}
.section h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:56px}

.bento{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.bcard{background:#12102A;border:1px solid var(--color-border-2);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:32px;transition:border-color .25s,transform .25s,box-shadow .25s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.bcard:hover{border-color:var(--color-border-3);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.bcard-wide{grid-column:span 2}
.bcard-accent{background:var(--color-primary-dim);border-color:rgba(124,92,252,.25)}
.bcard-accent:hover{border-color:var(--color-primary);box-shadow:var(--glow-primary)}
.bcard-icon{width:48px;height:48px;background:var(--color-surface-2);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--color-primary-2)}
.bcard-icon--teal{color:var(--color-secondary)}
.bcard-icon--inv{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff}
.bcard h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700}
.bcard p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-2);line-height:1.6}
.tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--color-secondary-dim);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(45,212,191,.2);margin-top:auto}
.tag--inv{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25)}
.bcard-preview{width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--radius-md);opacity:.9}

.steps{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px}
.step{flex:1;background:#12102A;border:1px solid var(--color-border-2);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:32px;transition:border-color .25s}
.step:hover{border-color:var(--color-border-3)}
.step-num{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);opacity:.4;margin-bottom:8px}
.step h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
.step p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-2)}
.step-line{flex:0 0 40px;height:1px;background:var(--color-border-2);margin-top:56px}

.pricing-wrap{max-width:760px}
.pricing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:0}
.pcard{background:#12102A;border:1px solid var(--color-border-2);border-radius:var(--radius-xl);padding:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;position:relative}
.pcard-featured{border-color:rgba(124,92,252,.4);box-shadow:var(--glow-primary)}
.pfeatured-label{position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--color-primary);color:#fff;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.tier{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--color-text-2)}
.price{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:3rem;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 16px}
.price span{font-size:1rem;color:var(--color-text-3)}
.pcard ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex:1}
.pcard li{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-2);padding-left:20px;position:relative}
.pcard li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary);opacity:.6}
.pcard .btn-ghost,.pcard .btn-pill{margin-top:24px}

.footer{padding:40px 32px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
.footer-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.footer-inner p{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--color-text-3)}

@media(max-width:768px){
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .hero{padding:120px 24px 80px}
  .hero-stats{gap:24px}
  .bento{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .bcard-wide{grid-column:span 1}
  .steps{flex-direction:column}
  .step-line{width:40px;height:1px;margin:0 auto}
  .pricing{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
